      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I guess if you're going to call people white knights for comments I shouldn't comment and leave you to it, but I was looking at the udon sharp reference a few hours ago and it says that vrcurl cannot be created at run time\n\nhttps://udonsharp.docs.vrchat.com/vrchat-api#vrcurl\n\nI guess look up data exfiltration when you have a chance? If you can construct a URL you can put information there. VRchat is going with \"Nintendo Hard\" for now.",
